OL,3,GNEWSASurgeon leaves hospital amid      
OL,4,Areview into patient harm               
OL,6,FA specialist surgeon has left a        
OL,7,Fworld-renowned NHS hospital            
OL,8,Finvestigating how hundreds of children 
OL,9,Fin its care were harmed.               
OL,11,FKuldeep Stohr had been suspended by    
OL,12,FCambridge's Addenbrooke's Hospital     
OL,13,Fsince 2025, over concerns about        
OL,14,Fsurgeries that fell "below the expected
OL,15,Fstandard".                             
OL,17,FAn interim report, published mistakenly
OL,18,Fin September, revealed 209 patients -  
OL,19,Fmostly children - "experienced harm"   
OL,20,Ffollowing surgery performed by Stohr   
OL,21,Fbetween 2012 and 2024.                 
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
